flowchart TB
  INTERNET[Internet and partner networks]
  EDGE[Protected edge: WAF, DDoS, API gateway, verification portal]
  APP[Application zone: domain workloads and service mesh]
  DATA[Restricted data zone: operational DB, ledger, evidence store]
  MGMT[Privileged management zone: PAM, CI/CD, bastion, break-glass]
  SOC[Security operations: SIEM, SOAR, monitoring, threat detection]
  HSM[HSM / KMS / PKI]

  INTERNET --> EDGE
  EDGE -->|authenticated, authorised and rate-limited| APP
  APP -->|workload identity and least privilege| DATA
  MGMT -->|approved privileged session| APP
  MGMT -->|approved privileged session| DATA
  HSM --> EDGE
  HSM --> APP
  EDGE --> SOC
  APP --> SOC
  DATA --> SOC
  MGMT --> SOC

